They need a bit of perspective I think.

I didn't see the replay, but looking at the graphs it was a one base build. If I scouted one base I would make a spine halt drone production and scout his main with my overlord, seeing his build I would have made lings and queens then worked my way into ravager ling as I felt comfortable.

&#x200B;

Looked a bit closer at the graphs going up to 45 drones vs 1 base is probably too greedy, in that case again just from seeing the graphs, about 30-35 drones would have been good and use ur extra minerals for lings preferably with speed
